# HakiOS fragment: the sc7280 family -- what is true of the SoC, whatever device it is in.
# The Redwood reference also enables SMP, clocks, PMIC, SOCINFO and THERMAL.
# Spacewar keeps those capabilities gated during bring-up; its device fragment
# currently builds only the read-only identity/temperature probes for phone tests.
CONFIG_SOC="sc7280"
